    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef95df1fc71e7849343b5aa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在平静的秋风中微笑的她。\n我觉得，她的身上仿佛充满了\n如那朵玫瑰一般柔韧的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c3889b5b4418e814d523244a125ee987d78b58d74be41c6ee563fc103760682",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
