    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97708c938704df774b306abb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "种在地里的这些不能移动，\n所以为了防霜，要在土上铺一层薄膜……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d6d8113c485459216bfb2a20e4b7936367ffd9a4cdce7130153663b9dc411c",
