      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……没关系的。\n训练员――请不要勉强。\n只要帮我搬轻一些的就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3854079562eda499a4d3b12031e8bd1a9f531ff99447b95959e3855b1c20791f",
