    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25ff2d477690b50c4c5b214",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "昨天，我在花店买了许多\n很有春天气息的花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c2c3b188243876d27d000673ea387cf155339bba262eda899c2c0c01ab6d25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eb88f1d5891eaafb697f4ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花动作麻利地工作着。\n我也努力帮忙了，但感觉好像\n并没有派上太大用场……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c709ff034b004b9cf6951cff28416822b33cee182bc4669d11645de2343e87f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134524.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068389abdecedb75ff1daa7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没事……抱歉，没能帮上什么忙",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3223ec0badded99deb4eff6fb7c7acaa8d3929198f83f0653595e318706b28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
